       "            style=\"position-anchor: --doc-link-fill_value;\">\n",
       "            fill_value: str or numerical value, default=None<br><br>When strategy == &quot;constant&quot;, `fill_value` is used to replace all<br>occurrences of missing_values. For string or object data types,<br>`fill_value` must be a string.<br>If `None`, `fill_value` will be 0 when imputing numerical<br>data and &quot;missing_value&quot; for strings or object data types.</span>\n",
       "        </a>\n",
