       "            <td class=\"param\">\n",
       "        <a class=\"param-doc-link\"\n",
       "            style=\"anchor-name: --doc-link-max_iter;\"\n",
       "            rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.Ridge.html#:~:text=max_iter,-int%2C%20default%3DNone\">\n",
       "            max_iter\n",
       "            <span class=\"param-doc-description\"\n",
       "            style=\"position-anchor: --doc-link-max_iter;\">\n",
       "            max_iter: int, default=None<br><br>Maximum number of iterations for conjugate gradient solver.<br>For &#x27;sparse_cg&#x27; and &#x27;lsqr&#x27; solvers, the default value is determined<br>by scipy.sparse.linalg. For &#x27;sag&#x27; solver, the default value is 1000.<br>For &#x27;lbfgs&#x27; solver, the default value is 15000.</span>\n",
       "        </a>\n",
