       "            keep_empty_features: bool, default=False<br><br>If True, features that consist exclusively of missing values when<br>`fit` is called are returned in results when `transform` is called.<br>The imputed value is always `0` except when `strategy=&quot;constant&quot;`<br>in which case `fill_value` will be used instead.<br><br>.. versionadded:: 1.2</span>\n",
